menu "MeshCore Watch motion features"

    config MCW_RAISE_TO_WAKE
        bool "Raise wrist to wake display"
        default y
        help
            Wake the display on a BHI260AP wrist tilt event while the screen is off.
            Enable GPIO8 as an additional EXT1 light-sleep wake source when available.
            Gestures while the display is awake do not extend its inactivity timeout.
            Disabling this option keeps step, wrist and motion sensor processing active.

endmenu
